    card title "How old are you?"

A: How do you ask someone's age in Russian, and give your own?
    draw cake qmark parallel true

A: Ско́лько тебе́ лет?
    draw g_q

A: Word for word: how many years to you? Ско́лько is the one from ско́лько сто́ит, and тебе́ is lesson nineteen's to you.
    highlight g_q_w_2 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase qmark

B: And I answer: мне два́дцать пять лет. I'm twenty-five.
    draw g_a

A: There's no word for am: the years go to you, мне, just as in мне нра́вится, where the coffee pleases me.
    highlight g_a_w_1 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase cake g_q g_a

A: These to-words have a grammar name, the dative, and you know three of them: мне, тебе́, and вам, for someone you call вы.
    draw p_ya a_ya f_ya g_ya p_ty a_ty f_ty g_ty p_vy a_vy f_vy g_vy h_known

B: Two are new: он becomes ему́, and она́ becomes ей. Ско́лько ему́ лет? How old is he?
    draw p_on a_on f_on g_on p_ona a_ona f_ona g_ona h_new e_on

    erase p_ya a_ya f_ya g_ya p_ty a_ty f_ty g_ty p_vy a_vy f_vy g_vy h_known p_on a_on f_on g_on p_ona a_ona f_ona g_ona h_new e_on

A: Now the word for years: it follows the number's last word. After оди́н, it's год: ему́ оди́н год, he's one.
    draw c1_d c1_w c1_e

B: After два, три or четы́ре, it's го́да: ей три го́да, she's three.
    draw c2_d c2_w c2_e

A: After anything else, it's лет: мне пять лет, мне два́дцать лет.
    draw c3_d c3_w c3_e

B: Лет isn't a form of год at all: it comes fro (@draw c_summer@)m ле́то, summer, as if you counted summers.

    erase c_summer

A: You've met this pattern twice already: рубль, рубля́, рубле́й, and час, часа́, часо́в.
    draw c1_r c2_r c3_r parallel true

    erase c1_r c2_r c3_r

B: So with a big number, only the last word counts: два́дцать оди́н год, два́дцать два го́да, два́дцать пять лет.
    draw c1_n c2_n c3_n

A: Careful with the teens: оди́ннадцать s (@draw c3_x@)ounds as if it ends in оди́н, but a teen is one word, so it takes лет.

B: Двена́дцать лет, четы́рнадцать лет too, just as every teen took рубле́й and часо́в.
    highlight c3_x color #c9871a effect underline

    hide c1_n c2_n c3_n

    ask "Which word goes with три́дцать три? Tap it." choose ["c1_w","c2_w","c3_w"] answer c2_w voice b
        right: Три is one of two, three and four: три́дцать три го́да.
        wrong: Only the last word counts: here it's три.

    show c1_n c2_n c3_n

    pause 1

    hide c1_d c1_w c1_e c1_n c2_d c2_w c2_e c2_n c3_d c3_w c3_e c3_n c3_x

B: Now Tom asks me how old I am.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name parallel true

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, ско́лько тебе́ лет?","gloss":"Masha, how old are you?"},{"by":"b","text":"Мне два́дцать пять лет.","gloss":"I'm twenty-five."},{"by":"a","text":"Мне три́дцать оди́н год.","gloss":"I'm thirty-one."},{"by":"a","text":"А брат? Ско́лько ему́ лет?","gloss":"And your brother? How old is he?"},{"by":"b","text":"Ему́ два́дцать два го́да.","gloss":"He's twenty-two."}] size 1.3

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Listen to the last word of each number: пять, so лет.
    highlight talk_2_words part "пять лет" color #c9871a effect underline

B: Оди́н, so год.
    highlight talk_3_words part "оди́н год" color #c9871a effect underline

A: And два, so го́да.
    highlight talk_5_words part "два го́да" color #c9871a effect underline

B: And брат is an он, so Tom asked ско́лько ему́ лет.
    highlight talk_4_words part ему́ color #c9871a effect underline

    erase talk

    hide speakers

    icon t_cake size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["shortcake","cake"] icon_look picture of "birthday cake"

    quiz "Ask a friend how old they are. Pick one." store q1 reveal.text "Ско́лько тебе́ лет?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: The years go to your friend, so it's the to-word.
        wrong: Age is given to someone: you need the to-word for ты.
        + Ско́лько тебе́ лет?
        * Ско́лько ты лет?
        * Ско́лько сто́ит?

    pause 1.2

    erase t_cake q1_stamp

    icon t_girl size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["woman"] icon_look picture of girl

    quiz "What does Ей три го́да mean? Pick one." store q2 reveal.text "Ей три го́да." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ей is the to-word for она́: three years to her.
        wrong: Ей belongs to она́; for он it would be ему́.
        + She is three.
        * He is three.
        * I am three.

    pause 1.2

    erase t_girl q2_stamp

    icon t_boy size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["child"] icon_look picture of boy

    quiz "A boy is four: Ему́ четы́ре … Which word fills the gap?" store q3 reveal.text "Ему́ четы́ре го́да." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Two, three and four take the same word.
        wrong: Four is in the middle group, with two and three.
        * год
        + го́да
        * лет

    pause 1.2

    erase t_boy q3_stamp

    icon t_man size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man

    quiz "Tom is thirty-one: Мне три́дцать оди́н … Which word fills the gap?" store q4 reveal.text "Мне три́дцать оди́н год." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: The last word is оди́н, so the one-word.
        wrong: Only the last word counts, and here it's оди́н.
        + год
        * го́да
        * лет

    pause 1.2

    erase t_man q4_stamp

    icon t_girl2 size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["woman"] icon_look picture of girl

    ask "A girl is twelve: Ей двена́дцать … Type the missing word." answer ["лет"] store q5 default лет reveal.text "Ей двена́дцать лет." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Eleven to fourteen always take лет, whatever their last digit.
        wrong: Twelve is a teen, one word, not два: so not го́да.

    pause 1.2

    erase t_girl2 q5_stamp

    show c1_d c1_w c1_e c1_n c2_d c2_w c2_e c2_n c3_d c3_w c3_e c3_n c3_x

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So in Russian your age is given to you: мне, тебе́, ему́, ей, then the number, and its last word picks год, го́да or лет.
    highlight c1_w c2_w c3_w color #c9871a effect underline

    erase c1_d c1_w c1_e c1_n c2_d c2_w c2_e c2_n c3_d c3_w c3_e c3_n c3_x

B: Мне два́дцать пять лет! Next time, a whole story made from everything so far. Пока́!
    icon e_cake size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 540 or ["shortcake","cake"] icon_look picture of "birthday cake"
    text e_line "Мне два́дцать пять лет!" #3d3833 say "Мне два́дцать пять лет!" say_voice b x 500 y 360 font_size 66

